Route36_Text_Woman2_1::
	.string "An odd tree is blocking the way\n"
	.string "to GOLDENROD CITY.\p"
	.string "It’s preventing me from shopping.\n"
	.string "Something should be done about it.$"

Route36_Text_Woman2_2::
	.string "That odd tree disappeared without a\n"
	.string "trace.\p"
	.string "Oh! That tree was really a POKéMON?$"

Route36_Text_FatMan_1::
	.string "Wa-hey!\p"
	.string "I was going to snap that tree\n"
	.string "with my straight-arm punch.\p"
	.string "But I couldn’t!\n"
	.string "I’m a failure!$"

Route36_Text_FatMan_2::
	.string "Did you clear that wretched tree?\p"
	.string "I’m impressed!\n"
	.string "I want you to have this.$"

Route36_Text_FatMan_3::
	.string "That happens to be ROCK SMASH.\p"
	.string "You can shatter rocks with just a\n"
	.string "single well-aimed smack.\p"
	.string "If any rocks are in your way, just\n"
	.string "smash ’em up!$"

Route36_Text_Fossil_1::
	.string "Is the tree moving?$"

Route36_Text_Fossil_2::
	.string "It’s a weird tree. Use SQUIRTBOTTLE?$"

Route36_Text_Fossil_3::
	.string "{PLAYER} used the SQUIRTBOTTLE.\p"
	.string "The weird tree doesn’t like the\n"
	.string "SQUIRTBOTTLE!$"

Route36_Text_PsychicMarkIntro::
	.string "I’m going to read your thoughts!$"

Route36_Text_PsychicMarkDefeat::
	.string "I misread you!$"

Route36_Text_PsychicMark::
	.string "I’d be strong if only I could tell\n"
	.string "what my opponent was thinking.$"

Route36_Text_Schoolboy306Intro::
	.string "Thanks to my studies, I’m ready for\n"
	.string "any POKéMON!$"

Route36_Text_Schoolboy306Defeat::
	.string "Oops! Computation error?$"

Route36_Text_Schoolboy306::
	.string "Darn. I study five hours a day too.\p"
	.string "There’s a lot you can’t learn just\n"
	.string "by reading books.$"

Route36_Text_Sign1::
	.string "ROUTE 36$"

Route36_Text_Sign2::
	.string "RUINS OF ALPH\n"
	.string "NORTH ENTRANCE$"

Route36_Text_Sign3::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "POKéMON stats vary--even within\n"
	.string "the same species.\p"
	.string "Their stats may be similar at first.\p"
	.string "However, differences will become\n"
	.string "pronounced as the POKéMON grow.$"

Route36_Text_Sign4::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "Use DIG to return to the entrance of\n"
	.string "any place.\p"
	.string "It is convenient for exploring\n"
	.string "caves and other landmarks.$"

Route36_Text_Sign5::
	.string "It’s a fruit-bearing tree.\p"
	.string "Hey! It’s ASPEAR BERRY!$"

